menuconfig MODULES_PARAM_CONTROL
	bool "param_control (IFSC-Station placeholder)"
	default n
	---help---
		Enable the param_control module, which is currently being used as the
		IFSC-Station placeholder. It exposes the IFSC_DIST_SW parameter to
		QGroundControl and prints a banner when the user toggles between
		PID Control (0) and Param Control (1).

menuconfig USER_PARAM_CONTROL
	bool "param_control running as userspace module"
	default n
	depends on BOARD_PROTECTED && MODULES_PARAM_CONTROL
	---help---
		Put param_control in userspace memory